msgid ""
"where the **+backgrounds** and **+3D** aliases were added to the default ones."
msgstr "其中***+背景**和**+3D**别名被添加到默认别名中。"

#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:190
msgid "**To add more default folders to projects:**"
msgstr "**要向项目添加更多默认文件夹，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:192
msgid "Open the ``OpenToonz stuff\\profiles\\project_folders.txt``  file."
msgstr "打开“OpenToonz stuff\\profiles\\project_folders.txt”文件。"

#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:194
msgid ""
"List the default folders you want to define, one per line, and save the file."
msgstr "列出要定义的默认文件夹，每行一个，然后保存文件。"

#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:200
msgid "Using the $scenepath Variable in Folder Definition"
msgstr "Using the $scenepath Variable in Folder Definition"

#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:201
msgid ""
"The $scenepath variable can also be used in the definition of the **+inputs**, "
"**+drawings**, and **+extras** aliases when typing the default folder path. In "
"this case the path where you save the current scene will replace the "
"$scenepath variable in the path definition, with the needed folders "
"automatically created during the saving process."
msgstr ""
"在键入默认文件夹路径时，$scenepath变量也可用于定义**+输入**、**+绘图**和**+附加"
"**别名。在这种情况下，保存当前场景的路径将用保存过程中自动创建的所需文件夹替换"
"路径定义中的$scenepath变量。"

#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:203
msgid ""
"For example if **+drawings** is ``$scenepath\\mydrawings,`` and you save the "
"scene scene01 in ``+scenes\\seq01`` , OpenToonz drawn or cleaned up levels for "
"that scene will be saved in ``seq01\\scene01\\mydrawings`` ; when you save the "
"scene scene02, in ``seq01\\scene02\\mydrawings`` ; and so on."
msgstr ""
"例如，如果**+绘图**是“$scenepath\\mydrawings”，并且您将场景scene01保存在“+scene"
"\\seq01”中，则为该场景绘制或清理的OpenToonz级别将保存"
"在“seq01\\scene01\\mydrawing”中；在“seq01\\scene02\\mydrawings”中保存场景"
"scene02时；等等。"

#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:205
msgid ""
"In this way the needed default folders are automatically created with the same "
"given name (mydrawings), one for each scene, according to the path used when "
"saving the scene. As a consequence, if the variable is used in this way for "
"all the aliases, all the files related to a scene will be stored in a folder "
"named as the scene."
msgstr ""
"通过这种方式，根据保存场景时使用的路径，自动创建具有相同给定名称（mydrawings）"
"的所需默认文件夹，每个场景一个。因此，如果变量以这种方式用于所有别名，则与场景"
"相关的所有文件都将存储在名为场景的文件夹中。"

#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:207
msgid "|scenepath_variable|"
msgstr "|scenepath_变量|"

#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:209
msgid ""
"A second example: if **+drawings** is ``mydrawings\\$scenepath,`` when you "
"save the scene scene01 in ``+scenes\\seq01`` , OpenToonz drawn or cleaned up "
"levels for that scene will be saved in ``mydrawings\\seq01\\scene01`` ; when "
"you save the scene scene02, in ``mydrawings\\seq01\\scene02`` ; and so on."
msgstr ""
"第二个例子：如果**+drawings**是“mydrawings \\$scenepath”，当您将场景scene01保存"
"在“+scenes\\seq01”中时，OpenToonz为该场景绘制或清理的级别将保存在“mydrawings"
"\\seq01\\scene01”中；当您在“mydrawings\\seq01\\scene02”中保存场景scene02时；等"
"等。"

#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:211
msgid ""
"In this case the needed default folders are automatically created with the "
"name and path of folders used when saving the scene, inside the path specified "
"(mydrawings). As a consequence, if the variable is used in this way for all "
"the aliases, all the files used in the project will be stored in a main folder "
"for each alias, whose content is divided into folders named as the scenes."
msgstr ""
"在这种情况下，所需的默认文件夹会自动创建，其中包含保存场景时使用的文件夹的名称"
"和路径，位于指定的路径（mydrawings）内。因此，如果以这种方式将变量用于所有别"
"名，则项目中使用的所有文件都将存储在每个别名的主文件夹中，其内容将分为名为场景"
"的文件夹。"

#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:213
msgid ""
"The definition of the **+palettes** alias cannot include $scenepath, as the "
"palettes refer to the whole project, not to specific scenes."
msgstr ""
"**+调色板**别名的定义不能包含$scenepath，因为调色板指的是整个项目，而不是特定的"
"场景。"

#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:215
msgid ""
"It is not possible to use at the same time for an alias the $scenepath "
"variable in folder definition and the Append $scenepath option."
msgstr "文件夹定义中的$scenepath变量和Append$scenepass选项不能同时用于别名。"

#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:221
msgid "Using the Append $scenepath Option"
msgstr "使用Append$scenepath选项"

#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:222
msgid ""
"The Append $scenepath option is available for the **+inputs**, **+drawings** "
"and **+extras** aliases. If you activate the Append $scenepath option for an "
"alias, the path where you save the current scene will be added to the path of "
"the alias, with the needed folders automatically created during the saving "
"process."
msgstr ""
"Append$scenepath选项可用于**+输入**、**+绘图**和**+附加**别名。如果为别名激活"
"Append$scenepath选项，则保存当前场景的路径将添加到别名的路径中，并在保存过程中"
"自动创建所需的文件夹。"

#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:224
msgid ""
"For example if **+drawings** is ``mydrawings`` , and you save the scene "
"scene01 in ``+scenes\\seq01`` , OpenToonz drawn or cleaned up levels for that "
"scene will be saved in ``mydrawings\\seq01\\scene01`` ; if you save the scene "
"scene02 in ``+scenes\\seq01`` , OpenToonz drawn or cleaned up levels for that "
"scene will be saved in ``mydrawings\\seq01\\scene02`` ; and so on."
msgstr ""
"例如，如果**+drawings**是“mydrawings”，并且您将场景scene01保存在“+scenes"
"\\seq01”中，则为该场景绘制或清理的OpenToonz级别将保存在“mydrawings"
"\\seq01\\scene01”中；如果将场景scene02保存在“+scenes\\seq01”中，则OpenToonz为该"
"场景绘制或清理的级别将保存在“mydrawings\\seq01\\scene02”中；等等。"

#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:226
msgid "|append_scenepath|"
msgstr "|附录_附件|"

#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:228
msgid ""
"This allows OpenToonz to create scene-related folders automatically when "
"saving OpenToonz files or importing external files, while allowing the use of "
"the generic aliases **+drawings**, **+inputs** and **+extras**, no matter "
"where levels are loaded from within the current project."
msgstr ""
"这允许OpenToonz在保存OpenToonz文件或导入外部文件时自动创建与场景相关的文件夹，"
"同时允许使用通用别名**+图形**、**+输入**和**+附加**，无论从当前项目中的哪个位置"
"加载级别。"

#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:230
msgid ""
"When a scene is saved in the **+scenes** folder, the value for $scenepath is "
"the scene name; for example if you save the scene scene02 in **+scenes**, "
"$scenepath will be scene02."
msgstr ""
"当场景保存在**+scenes**文件夹中时，$scenepath的值是场景名称；例如，如果将场景"
"scene02保存在**+scenes**中，$scenepath将是scene02。"

#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:232
msgid ""
"It is not possible to use for an alias the Append $scenepath option and at the "
"same time the $scenepath variable in defining the related folder."
msgstr ""
"在定义相关文件夹时，不能同时使用Append$scenepath选项和$scenepass变量作为别名。"

#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:238
msgid "Using the Project Browser"
msgstr "使用项目浏览器"

#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:239
msgid ""
"The project browser is available at the end of the file browser tree. It lists "
"all of the projects that have been created, whose actual location is in the "
"projectroot that was defined in the initial installation of OpenToonz. The "
"projectroot value is displayed in brackets."
msgstr ""
"项目浏览器位于文件浏览器树的末尾。它列出了所有已创建的项目，其实际位置在"
"OpenToonz初始安装中定义的项目根中。projectroot值显示在括号中。"

#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:241
msgid "The name of the folders which the aliases point to are displayed in blue."
msgstr "别名指向的文件夹名称以蓝色显示。"

#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:243
msgid ""
"In case more than one projectroot is defined, each will be listed with the "
"related projectroot value in brackets (see  :ref:`Setting the Projectroot "
"<setting_the_projectroot>`  )."
msgstr ""
"如果定义了多个项目根，则每个项目根都将在括号中列出相关的项目根值（请参阅：ref:`"
"设置项目根<Setting_the_projectroot>`）。"

#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:248
msgid "Default Folders with Relative Paths"
msgstr "具有相对路径的默认文件夹"

#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:249
msgid ""
"When default folders are defined by using a relative path, in the project "
"browser you will see all the folders specified in the path under the "
"projectroot, and the project folders tree will be the same of the file system "
"tree. The folders that are the target of the paths are displayed in blue."
msgstr ""
"当使用相对路径定义默认文件夹时，在项目浏览器中，您将看到项目根下路径中指定的所"
"有文件夹，项目文件夹树将与文件系统树相同。作为路径目标的文件夹以蓝色显示。"

#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:251
msgid ""
"For example, for the project Project01, with **+drawings** that is "
"``section01\\prod drawings`` , the project browser will display the following:"
msgstr ""
"例如，对于项目Project01，使用**+图纸**即“section01\\prod图纸”，项目浏览器将显示"
"以下内容："

