#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:287
msgid "Default Folders with Absolute Paths"
msgstr "具有绝对路径的默认文件夹"

#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:288
msgid ""
"When default folders are defined by using an absolute path, in the project "
"browser you will see only the related aliases, whatever their location on the "
"network is. In this way you can quickly access the production material without "
"browsing the computer, or the network. The aliases are displayed in blue, "
"because they are the location the default folders paths point to."
msgstr ""
"当使用绝对路径定义默认文件夹时，在项目浏览器中，您将只看到相关的别名，无论它们"
"在网络上的位置如何。通过这种方式，您可以快速访问生产资料，而无需浏览计算机或网"
"络。别名显示为蓝色，因为它们是默认文件夹路径指向的位置。"

#: ../../source/managing_projects.rst:290
msgid ""
"For example, for the project Project01, with **+drawings** that is ``C:"
"\\production\\prod drawings`` on Windows, or ``/Volume/Macintosh HD/production/"
"prod drawings`` on Macintosh, the project browser will display the following:"
