"``C:\\prod drawings\\$scenepath`` on Windows, or ``/Volume/Macintosh HD/prod "
"drawings/$scenepath`` on Macintosh, and you save the scene scene01 in ``+scenes"
"\\seq01`` , the project browser will display the same as above, but this time "
"**+drawings** is ``C:\\prod drawings\\seq01\\scene01`` on Windows, or ``/"
"Volume/Macintosh HD/prod drawings/seq01/scene01`` on Macintosh."
